OL,3,GNEWSASix people injured after sign
OL,4,Afalls at Christian festival
OL,5,
OL,6,FSix people have been injured by a
OL,7,Ffalling sign at a Christian festival in
OL,8,FWest Sussex.
OL,10,FEmergency services were called to
OL,11,Freports of multiple people in need of
OL,12,Fmedical attention at Wiston Park, near
OL,13,FSteyning, shortly after 15:30 BST on
OL,14,FFriday.
OL,16,FAmbulance crews, critical care
OL,17,Fparamedics and specialist response
OL,18,Fteams are at the scene, according to
OL,19,FSouth East Coast Ambulance Service.
OL,23,APub: 28-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
