OL,3,GNEWSASix people injured after sign
OL,4,Afalls at Christian festival
OL,5,
OL,6,FTraffic disruption is expected in the
OL,7,Farea, and the public are urged to seek
OL,8,Falternative routes, Sussex Police said.
